<div class="content">
  <h1>${$global.title}</h1>
  <div class="content-body" no-parse>
    <h1 id="markdown-api" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#markdown-api">#</a> Markdown API</h1>
<p>Programmatic API for markdown processing.</p>
<h2 id="parsemarkdown()" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#parsemarkdown()">#</a> parseMarkdown()</h2>
<p>Parse markdown content to HTML:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">import</span><span style="color:#24292E"> { parseMarkdown } </span><span style="color:#D73A49">from</span><span style="color:#032F62"> 'markopress/markdown'</span><span style="color:#24292E">;</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">const</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> result</span><span style="color:#D73A49"> =</span><span style="color:#D73A49"> await</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> parseMarkdown</span><span style="color:#24292E">(</span><span style="color:#032F62">'# Hello</span><span style="color:#005CC5">\n\n</span><span style="color:#032F62">World!'</span><span style="color:#24292E">);</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#6A737D">// Returns: { html, headers, frontmatter }</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="options" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#options">#</a> Options</h2>
<p>Configure parsing behavior:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">const</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> result</span><span style="color:#D73A49"> =</span><span style="color:#D73A49"> await</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> parseMarkdown</span><span style="color:#24292E">(content, {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">  lineNumbers: </span><span style="color:#005CC5">true</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">  theme: </span><span style="color:#032F62">'github-light'</span><span style="color:#24292E">,</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">});</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="result-object" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#result-object">#</a> Result Object</h2>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">interface</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> MarkdownResult</span><span style="color:#24292E"> {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  html</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E">;           </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// Rendered HTML</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  headers</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> Header</span><span style="color:#24292E">[];      </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// Document headers</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  frontmatter</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#24292E"> {         </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// Parsed frontmatter</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">    title</span><span style="color:#D73A49">?:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E">;</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">    description</span><span style="color:#D73A49">?:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E">;</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">    [</span><span style="color:#E36209">key</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E">]</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> any</span><span style="color:#24292E">;</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="8"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">  };</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="10"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="headers" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#headers">#</a> Headers</h2>
<p>Headers structure for TOC:</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light line-numbers"><code><span class="line" data-line="1"><span class="line"><span style="color:#D73A49">interface</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> Header</span><span style="color:#24292E"> {</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  level</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> number</span><span style="color:#24292E">;      </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// 1-6</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  title</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E">;      </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// Header text</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  id</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#005CC5"> string</span><span style="color:#24292E">;         </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// Anchor ID</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span class="line"><span style="color:#E36209">  children</span><span style="color:#D73A49">:</span><span style="color:#6F42C1"> Header</span><span style="color:#24292E">[]; </span><span style="color:#6A737D">// Nested headers</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">}</span></span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span class="line"></span></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="extensions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#extensions">#</a> Extensions</h2>
<p>Built-in markdown extensions:</p>
<ul>
<li>GitHub Flavored Markdown</li>
<li>Custom containers</li>
<li>Syntax highlighting</li>
<li>Emoji support</li>
<li>Task lists</li>
</ul>
